### List rooms through Gateway
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels

### Book a room through Gateway
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "roomId": 101,
  "checkIn": "2026-07-01",
  "checkOut": "2026-07-03"
}

### List orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### See RabbitMQ and Kafka consumed events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/booking-events

### See RabbitMQ consumed events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/booking-events/rabbitmq

### See Kafka consumed events
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/booking-events/kafka

### Kafka normal send and Broker ACK
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/normal?key=room-101

### Kafka same-key partition ordering
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/key-order?key=room-101&count=5

### Kafka consumer groups and deterministic partition coverage
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/group?count=9

### Kafka asynchronous batch, compression and linger
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/async-batch?count=20

### Kafka database-backed consumer idempotency
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/duplicate?messageId=KMSG-DEMO-DUP

### Kafka blocking retry and DLT
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/dead-letter?key=room-102

### Kafka poison JSON and ErrorHandlingDeserializer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/poison?key=room-103

### Kafka committed transaction: both records become visible
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/transaction?failAfterFirst=false

### Kafka aborted transaction: read_committed consumers see neither record
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/transaction?failAfterFirst=true

### Pause primary group, then publish messages and observe lag
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/consumer/pause

### Resume primary group and observe lag return to zero
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/consumer/resume

### Kafka topics, offsets, lag, DLT incidents and persisted idempotency records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mq-demo/kafka/status
